```ts
async function retryDocument(document) {
  if (retryingId.value) return
  retryingId.value = document.id
  try {
    const updated = await knowledgeApi.retry(document.id)
    ElMessage.success(updated.status === 'ready' ? '已重新入库' : '已提交重试')
    await load({ reset: true })
    selected.value = items.value.find((item) => item.id === updated.id) ?? updated
  } catch ... finally { retryingId.value = null; }
}
```
Careful: `load` while retryingId set → button disabled; reset after. Also if filter excludes, selected stays updated (drawer shows ready) — good.

